"li",null,{"children":"A calendar as month grids and as a list, a page per event, original organizer links, individual .ics downloads, and calendar-subscription instructions."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A branded signup demonstration with topic selection, validation, simulated confirmation, preference changes, a data download, and unsubscribing."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A sample email, responsive layouts, keyboard-friendly controls, a favicon, and a matching social-sharing image."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Real content, clearly dated"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The event list is a saved snapshot of the live calendar: ",8," upcoming events as of ","10 October 2026",". It does not update on its own: rebuilding the demo takes a fresh one. Original organizer announcements remain the source of truth. No RSVP, subscription, email, or data submission happens anywhere in this demo."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The live hub’s imprint identifies L. David Weil as its responsible contact. The listed communities have independent organizers; this redesign does not imply their endorsement."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before this becomes the live site"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Read the calendar as it updates rather than at build time, keep last-known events when a source fails, and show a real last-successful-update timestamp."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Connect the signup to the existing mailing-list service, including consent, confirmation, actual preference management, deletion, error handling, and abuse prevention."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Confirm event languages, fees, access information, club eligibility, and the mailing frequency. Do not apply one group’s policies to every group."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Invite organizers to approve their introductions and any named contact profiles. Add real gathering photographs and participant quotations only with permission."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Review the live privacy policy, legal details, sharing URLs, and search metadata. Remove the demo notice and no-index setting only when ready to publish."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Try the design with first-time visitors and incorporate their feedback."}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]]}],"$L19"]
